{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的歌和羔羊的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看见天上又有一个宏大奇异的景象，有七位天使掌管着最后的七种灾祸，上帝要借这些灾祸发尽祂的烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看见一个好像夹杂着火的玻璃海，玻璃海上站着那些战胜怪兽、兽像及兽名代号的人。他们手里拿着上帝所赐的竖琴，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["口里唱着上帝的奴仆摩西的歌和羔羊的歌：",{"text":"“全能的主上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的作为伟大奇妙！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国的王啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的道路公义真实！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，谁敢不敬畏你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不归荣耀给你的名呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为只有你是圣洁的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万民都必到你面前敬拜你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你公义的作为已经彰显出来了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["天使降七灾"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["此后，我看见天上的圣殿，就是存放约柜的圣幕打开了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那掌管七种灾祸的七位天使都从殿中出来，身穿洁白发光的细麻布衣服，胸束金带。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["四个活物中的一个将七只金碗分别交给七位天使，碗中盛满了永活上帝的烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["殿里弥漫着上帝的荣耀和权能散发的烟雾，人们必须等到七位天使将七样灾祸降完，才能进入圣殿。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}